oocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69140\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69140</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Stop taxing a zone Local pickup order at the block pickup location whose list position matches the method&#8217;s instance id. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69346\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69346</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Stop the Checkout block from briefly showing &#8220;no payment methods available&#8221; while the cart loads. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69853\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69853</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Stop the classic checkout saving orders without shipping when shipping costs are hidden until an address is entered. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69742\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69742</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Stop the email template update review from saying structural changes were applied automatically, since they are never applied. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69340\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69340</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Store API: report the checkout as successful when a failure happens after the gateway has taken payment, so shoppers are no longer told to retry an order that already succeeded.</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Store API: stop an extension whose data or schema callback throws from receiving another extension&#8217;s data <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68397\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68397</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Store the default Cart page cross-sells heading as a block pattern reference so it follows the site language instead of the install language. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68500\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68500</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Treat an array-valued key on the Blocks order confirmation page as absent so it falls through to the invalid-order handling instead of fataling in hash_equals(). <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68584\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68584</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Use the address entered in the order editor when calculating tax for products added to manual orders. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69518\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69518</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Use the filterable coupon-removed message from <code>WC_Coupon::get_coupon_message()</code> when removing a coupon via AJAX. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69271\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69271</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Validate posted Back in Stock variation attributes against the values the store offers, look up an existing sign-up with a single exact query, and check the sign-up rate limit before it. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68915\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68915</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Apply product visibility checks before rendering add-to-cart shortcodes. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70400\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70400</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Don&#8217;t grant downloads for order lines that were refunded before the order was completed. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70545\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70545</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fix cross-sell Add to cart buttons sometimes not responding in Safari and other browsers. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70402\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70402</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Improve the consistency of Product Filters prices and counts across user roles. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70356\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70356</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Make variation details loaded on the product page follow the product password setting. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70382\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70382</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Prevent back-in-stock notification saves that only change meta from re-saving the notification, which stored newly added meta (e.g. the unsubscribe key) twice. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70522\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70522</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Reject back-in-stock sign-ups for products the shopper cannot view <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70419\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70419</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Show sale prices in the Store API and grouped product structured data only after the scheduled sale starts. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70540\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70540</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Stop showing the post-checkout &#8220;Create account&#8221; form when the &#8220;After checkout&#8221; account creation setting was never saved. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70530\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70530</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Store API: reject an address change on the pay-for-order checkout endpoint when it would alter the order&#8217;s shipping cost or tax. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70364\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70364</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Store API reviews endpoint: include avatars data only if they are enabled on the site <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70521\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70521</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Strengthen download permission ID checks <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70334\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70334</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Keep coupon codes with special characters working on WordPress 7.2, show <code>&amp;</code> correctly in the coupon editor, and fix a critical error with some codes containing <code>&lt;</code>. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70683\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70683</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Exclude block editor note reactions from the cached comment counts. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70795\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70795</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Prevent account activation crashes with extensions that verify customer emails using the legacy one-argument call. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70808\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70808</a></li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Prevent invalid add-to-cart shortcodes from clearing the surrounding product context. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/70853\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#70853</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add ActionableAbility to the experimental extensible abilities feature. With it on, product create and product update accept extension fields under extensions.., and save Core and extension fields one time. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69681\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69681</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a location filter to the Analytics Taxes report, narrowing the report, its summary and its export to a country or a state. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68839\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68839</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an admin notice about the upcoming PHP 8.1 requirement in WooCommerce 11.6 for stores running an older PHP version. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69094\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69094</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an Inbox note on WooCommerce Home when active WooCommerce.com extensions have no subscription. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69509\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69509</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an opt-in filter (woocommerce_own_stock_hold_exclusion_threshold_minutes) for excluding a shopper&#8217;s own stale stock holds. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68963\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68963</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an <code>experimental__woocommerce_blocks-cart-updated</code> action so extensions can react after the Cart and Checkout blocks receive an updated cart. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69788\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69788</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a <code>[weight]</code> placeholder to flat rate shipping cost formulas, resolving to the total weight of the shippable items in the package or shipping class, in the store&#8217;s weight unit. Accepts optional <code>min</code> and <code>max</code> attributes, e.g. <code>[weight min=\"1\" max=\"20\"]</code>. Invalid weight limits produce a validation error when saving; decimal limits use a dot and no thousands separators. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68835\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68835</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add block spacing style support to the Chips block <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68946\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68946</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add commodity code, country of origin and customs description fields to the product and variation editors. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69166\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69166</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add customs fields to products and variations in the REST API. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69165\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69165</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add ExtensibleAbilities::register_query_filter(). With the experimental extensible abilities feature on, the product and order list abilities accept extension filters under filters.extensions&#8230; <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69684\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69684</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add ExtensibleAbilities::register_validator() to the experimental extensible abilities feature. A validator can refuse a change before the one save, in the product abilities and in the ActionableAbility classes of extensions. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69683\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69683</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add guidance after the order withdrawal feature is enabled. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68687\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68687</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add opt-in UCP catalog search, lookup and product endpoints so AI shopping agents can browse the store. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69577\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69577</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add product type classes to the Add to Cart + Options block in legacy mode <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/69408\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#69408</a></li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:1035:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3641137\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3641137\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3641137\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3641137\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:14690:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">nice plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/smjb12/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3f9ad4ec9fba298d0ec0e0c484d7b6d01aa956709ac9fda449012fe1141f8245?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3f9ad4ec9fba298d0ec0e0c484d7b6d01aa956709ac9fda449012fe1141f8245?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/smjb12/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Serge Binesse <small>(smjb12)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 10, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>nice plugin, very useful, I like it</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Greatest Shopping Cart Plugin Ever</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/lynreese050/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e5c233682b8795ff8db01094cc6ef4b469504c01919208f5b046f2e37c147379?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e5c233682b8795ff8db01094cc6ef4b469504c01919208f5b046f2e37c147379?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/lynreese050/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">lynreese050</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 28, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can truly create shopify-like sites with this and have more control as you are using WordPress. WooCommerce is Truly a blessing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Plugin!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/saasha735/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ae338cac9d61a7b1d3e7e4b963bb550c4271e3926e4292d208d8578bc642f8dd?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ae338cac9d61a7b1d3e7e4b963bb550c4271e3926e4292d208d8578bc642f8dd?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/saasha735/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Mst. Somaiya Alam Asha <small>(saasha735)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 26, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Easy to use, flexible, and perfect for building an online store. Highly recommended!\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">excellent plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/shakil05/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/514e8899f1033ca76fcc7768a5bc7559e6262fa78af7816fce5ce598ffa68331?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/514e8899f1033ca76fcc7768a5bc7559e6262fa78af7816fce5ce598ffa68331?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/shakil05/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Md. Shakil Ahmmed Moni <small>(shakil05)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 26, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WooCommerce is a great tool for creating online stores. Its flexibility and open-source approach make it useful for both beginners and experienced developers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">The best pliggin for easy shop building</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sonyiashahmir/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/808eedfadbb55524e38f1fb5345465a353837b8edc5b927a413c207df936f0dd?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/808eedfadbb55524e38f1fb5345465a353837b8edc5b927a413c207df936f0dd?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sonyiashahmir/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">sonyiashahmir</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 26, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>the best</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Execellent plugins</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ms