(3576, 1, '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '[blocksy_breadcrumbs]https://localhost/carrental/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hsb-campus-commercial-20s.webm			<h2>About Us</h2>															<img width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" src=\"https://localhost/carrental/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/z561639909399532ab70f19082923f1f70329e5c051617-175349747154449795347.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h2>HSB-VNU</h2>', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3127-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '', 3127, 'https://localhost/carrental/?p=3576', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3577, 1, '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '[blocksy_breadcrumbs]https://localhost/carrental/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hsb-campus-commercial-20s.webm			<h2>About Us</h2>															<img width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" src=\"https://localhost/carrental/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/z561639909399532ab70f19082923f1f70329e5c051617-175349747154449795347.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h2>HSB-VNU</h2>		<p>Since its establishment in 1995 under Vietnam National University, Hanoi, Hanoi School of Business and Management (HSB) has consistently pursued the vision of becoming a pioneering institution in internationally accredited business and management education and research, while contributing to the sustainable development of Vietnam. Through an interdisciplinary approach integrating three academic pillars — Management, Security, and Technology — HSB offers a distinctive model of education and research aimed at addressing practical challenges in an increasingly dynamic global context, shaping up future leaders in both public and private sectors</p>', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3127-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '2026-11-16 15:26:51', '', 3127, 'https://localhost/carrental/?p=3577', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
